# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local-only: AI assistant config, editor config, toolchain, environment paths.
# Keep these out of the lab remote. Last matching rule wins, so this block
# overrides the templated rules above.
#
# Appended to the mirrored .gitignore by tools/sync-lab.sh, which also uses the
# combined file to decide which paths are shareable. Edit the policy here, not
# in the lab repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# AI assistant customization
.github/
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
GEMINI.md
.claude/
.codex/
.cursor/
.gemini/
.continue/
.windsurf/
.opencode/
.roo*
.aider*
.memories/

# Editor / IDE
.vscode/
.idea/

# Toolchain and formatter/linter config
.pixi/
pixi.toml
pixi.lock
air.toml
jarl.toml
.lintr
.prettierrc
.prettierignore

# Environment (machine-specific absolute paths)
.env
.env.*
*.env

# Local toolchain bootstrap
package.R

# Sync tooling itself; belongs to the personal repository only
tools/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Markdown: excluded everywhere, then re-included by exact allowlist below.
# Covers paired script docs, plan/progress notes, and diagram briefs in any
# directory, including new top-level pipeline folders. Add a path to the
# allowlist only when it is a deliberate deliverable for the lab remote.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.md

# Allowlist: repository entry points and deliberate shared documents.
# Anchor each path with a leading slash so it names one exact file.
!README.md
# !/<shared-document>.md
# !/<track>/README.md

*.code-workspace
